# Salamander CTI detection ruleset  //  https://salacti.com
# DeadLock ransomware: Breaking down a Rust-based encryptor with decentralized recovery infrastructure  (defensive signatures; not endorsements)

alert dns any any -> any any (msg:"[Salamander CTI] DeadLock infrastructure domain"; dns.query; content:"deadlock.liveblog365.com"; nocase; classtype:trojan-activity; reference:url,https://salacti.com; sid:6100001; rev:1;)
